Subject: [PATCH] Connect camera reactions to the bandit and emotion to the
 arms.

An unhappy group_liking now lowers that song and its genre. Happy arms swing fast, large, and out of phase; sad arms swing slow, small, and together. Numbers live in motion/control/arm_params.py.
